      "prompt": "Use the reference images' exact pixel-art style, palette and textures (Pokemon Mystery Dungeon Explorers of Sky, golden spring cave): flat golden-ochre sandy cave floor with fine speckled pixel texture; cave walls made of piled rounded golden sandstone boulders; cascading travertine terraces of small rounded turquoise water pools with scalloped pale-gold stone rims and bright cyan-white ripple highlights; small pale rock spires; stalactites hanging along the top cave wall. Create a NEW map, WIDE LANDSCAPE 4:3, zoomed out, top-down view (1200 x 896). The player arrives from the SOUTH edge on a wide sandy path between boulder walls, which opens into a large open golden-sand cave chamber. At the NORTH, in the middle of the back wall under the stalactites, a dark cave tunnel entrance; the sand floor leads right up to it, with no water in front of it. On the left and right sides of the chamber, big stepped terraces of turquoise travertine pools climb up between the boulder walls. Four small pale rock spires stand on the sand, away from the central path. Boulder walls fill the map corners and edges, no empty black void. IMPORTANT: no characters, no text, no UI, no border, no sparkles.",
